SHEET 1 880 680
TEXT -16 -40 Left 2 ;JCM800 2203 FMV tone stack + master - SushiDSP spec D6d block 4. Probe node: out.
TEXT -16 8 Left 2 !.param AMP=1 BASS=0.5 MID=0.5 TREBLE=0.5 MASTER=1\nV1 in 0 SINE(0 {AMP} 1k) AC 1\n* 470p treble cap into the 220k treble pot; wiper is the stack output\nC1 in t1 470p\nRtreb_a t1 tsout {220k*(1-TREBLE)}\nRtreb_b tsout n2 {220k*TREBLE}\n* 33k slope resistor feeds the bottom of the treble pot\nR1 in n2 33k\n* 22n bass cap in series with the 1M bass pot (rheostat)\nC2 n2 b1 22n\nRbass b1 n4 {1Meg*BASS}\n* 22n mid cap, in parallel with the bass branch, onto the 25k mid pot (rheostat)\nC3 n2 n4 22n\nRmid n4 0 {25k*MID}\n* 1M master volume at the stack output, before the phase inverter\nRmv_a tsout out {1Meg*(1-MASTER)}\nRmv_b out 0 {1Meg*MASTER}\n.step param MID list 0.1 0.5 0.9\n.options plotwinsize=0
TEXT -16 560 Left 2 ;ac dec 40 10 20k
TEXT -16 592 Left 2 ;tran 0 40m 20m 1u
TEXT -16 632 Left 2 ;The two lines above are the analyses tools/spice/export.py enables\nby rewriting their leading ';' into '!.' - exactly one at a time.
